{"name":"US.ConcentStructIndices","title":"Merchandise: Market concentration and structural change indices - Annual (analytical)","version":10007,"lastUpdated":"2026-10-23T16:15:50","defaults":{"measuresOnAxe":"page","measuresNotes":"<p><b><u>Concentration index:</u></b><br />\r\nThe normalized formula of Herfindahl-Hirschmann index (Market HHI) is used to measure the degree of market concentration.<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img src=\"http://unctadstat.unctad.org/UnctadStatMetadata/NotesImg/ConcentrationIndexByProduct.jpg\" /></p><p>where&nbsp;<br />\r\nHi = value of concentration index for product i<br />\r\nxij = value of export for country&nbsp;j and product&nbsp; i</p><p><img src=\"http://unctadstat.unctad.org/UnctadStatMetadata/NotesImg/Total_Xi.jpg\" /></p><p>n = number of individual markets (countries)</p><p>Index values closer to 1 indicate highly concentrated export or import markets. On the contrary, a value closer to 0 reflects a more homogeneous distribution of market shares among countries.</p><p><b><u>Structural change index</u>:</b><br />\r\nThe structural change index is a measure of changes in the market structure of a product:</p><p><img src=\"http://unctadstat.unctad.org/UnctadStatMetadata/NotesImg/StructuralChangeIndex.jpg\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Where:<br />\r\nIi =value of structure index for product i (ranking from 0 to 1)<br />\r\nSij0 = share of trade of product i for country j for the reference year (1995)<br />\r\nSij1 = share of trade of product i for country j in the concerned year.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A value close to 1 for a product indicates a significant change in the market shares among exporters (or importers), compared to a reference year.</p>","showSingleMeasureHeader":true,"observations":[{"code":"6238","visible":true,"label":"Structural Change Index (1995=0)","isDefault":false,"measures":[{"code":"6238","label":"Structural Change Index (1995=0)","magnitudeLabel":"-","magnitude":1,"decimals":3,"selected":true}]},{"code":"6036","visible":true,"label":"Concentration Index","isDefault":true,"measures":[{"code":"6036","label":"Concentration Index","magnitudeLabel":"-","magnitude":1,"decimals":3,"selected":true}]}],"rowAxe":[{"name":"Products","label":"PRODUCT","notes":"<p>SITC (Rev. 3 at 1, 2 and 3-digit) group level</p>","field":"Product","refByCode":false,"isTime":false,"defaultCode":"TOTAL","hierarchyType":4,"codetype":"string","labelDisplayMode":"Labels Only"}],"colAxe":[{"name":"Years","label":"YEAR","notes":"","field":"Year","refByCode":true,"isTime":true,"defaultCode":"2025","hierarchyType":0,"codetype":"number","labelDisplayMode":"Codes Only"}],"pageAxe":[{"name":"Flows","label":"FLOW","notes":"","field":"Flow","refByCode":false,"isTime":false,"defaultCode":"02","hierarchyType":0,"codetype":"string","labelDisplayMode":"Labels Only"}]}}